            "review_text": "Turysta20144\nChester, United Kingdom284 contributions\n0\nGood value for money\nFeb 2017 • Business\nI had a bowl of soup, dessert and a starter. The food was nice and it was quite inexpensive considering that it is not far away from Chanel, Hermes etc. I also liked the fact that they have an outside terrace as I do not like sitting in air conditioned rooms. It is noisy outside, that is true- but find me a restaurant that has a peaceful surroundings in HCMC city centre!\nThe waiters were very polite and smiley. They did not speak very good English though, but somehow we managed to understand each other using hands. They were not very attentive though- I had to look for them to order a dish and also needed to go inside to pay as there was nobody around. Maybe the service is better if you sit inside... What bothered me though, is that the staff started cleaning the windows as people were sitting and eating- clearly there must be a better time to do such maintenance rather than when the restaurant has guests. Overall I think is was good, but trip advisor only allows average or very good score...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 27, 2017",
