            "review_text": "Calling out poor service\nBrisbane, Australia18 contributions\n0\nDisorganised at best.....\nJan 2017 • Family\nStaff were competent at writing down the beverages but possibly not the rest but we were then presented with random food. Tried and failed to reconcile with photo menu and some parts were suspiciously not vegetarian. Not going to try as they suggested.... we were about to leave when extra food arrived for take 2. \n\nSeems to be a bunch of nice kids who don't really know what's going on. Top tip for staff , write down the order and repeat to customer. They probably have been getting away with this for a while.\nRead more\nWritten January 22, 2017",
